Music hardware shortlist and prices
title end

paragraph start
For each need keep up to three candidates with price, seller, source and the date the price was seen. Prices change, so every price carries its check date.
paragraph end

paragraph start
No price is written from memory. Each is read from the seller page the day it is recorded.
paragraph end

